#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:47
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:47
msgid "Your membership expired on"
msgstr "La teva quota va caducar el"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:47
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:47
msgid "and therefore you aren't a member anymore."
msgstr "i per tant ja no ets membre."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:48
#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:52
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:52
msgid ""
"However, not all is lost! You can become a member easily, head to our "
"website to join."
msgstr ""
"Tanmateix, no tot està perdut! Et pots fer membre fàcilment visitant la "
"nostra pàgina web."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:51
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:51
msgid ""
"You don't have an active membership registered with this email and therefore "
"aren't a member."
msgstr ""
"No tens cap quota activa registrada amb aquest correu electrònic i, per "
"tant, no ets membre."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:65
#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/renew.html:16
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:65
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/expired.html:10
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/renew.html:15
msgid "Renew membership"
msgstr "Renova la quota"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/check.html:65
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:65
msgid "Join us"
msgstr "Uneix-te"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/expired.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/expired.html:5
msgid ""
"Your membership has expired and you can no longer enjoy all the benefits we "
"provide as well as attend our events. But not all is lost! You can renew it "
"at any time if you wish to do so."
msgstr ""
"La teva quota ha caducat i ja no pots gaudir de tots els avantatges que "
"oferim ni tampoc assistir als nostres esdeveniments. Però no tot està "
"perdut! Pots renovar-la en qualsevol moment si ho vols."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/expired.html:6
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/expired.html:13
msgid ""
"Your data will be kept for a total of two (2) years since the day your "
"membership expired. Afterwards, it will be deleted and recovery will not be "
"possible. If you wish to delete your data sooner as regulated in Article 17 "
"of the General Data Protection Regulation (Regulation (EU) 2016/679) please "
"send us an email with your request."
msgstr ""
"Les teves dades es conservaran durant un total de dos (2) anys a partir del "
"dia que va caducar la vostra quota. Posteriorment, s'eliminaran i no en serà "
"possible la recuperació. Si voleu eliminar les vostres dades abans així com "
"es regula a l'article 17 del Reglament General de Protecció de Dades "
"(Control (UE) 2016/679), envieu-nos un correu electrònic amb la vostra "
"sol·licitud."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/paid.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/paid.html:5
msgid ""
"Your membership has been marked as paid! You will find a summary right below."
msgstr ""
"La teva quota s'ha marcat com a pagada! En trobaràs un resum a continuació."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/renew.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/renew.html:5
msgid "Your membership will be expiring on"
msgstr "La teva quota caducarà el"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/renew.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/renew.html:5
msgid ""
"In order to enjoy all the benefits we provide as well as attend our events "
"you need to renew it before it expires."
msgstr ""
"Per continuar gaudint de tots els avantatges que oferim i assistir als "
"nostres esdeveniments, has de renovar-la abans que caduqui."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/renew.html:10
msgid ""
"This year playtime in Catalan will have an added cost per kid and includes "
"an improved schedule and activity plan. If you want to register your kid for "
"playtime you need to mark the checkbox, the total amount to be paid will be "
"updated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Enguany l'esplai tindrà un cost afegit per criatura i inclou una nova "
"estructura i pla d'activitats. Si vols registrar la teva canalla per "
"l'esplai has de seleccionar la casella corresponent, la quantitat total a "
"pagar s'actualitzarà automàticament."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/membership/renew.html:11
msgid "You can find the form to renew your membership in the following page."
msgstr ""
"Podeu trobar el formulari per renovar la vostra quota a la pàgina següent."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/order/created.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/order/created.html:5
msgid ""
"Thank you for your order! You will find a summary of the products you have "
"purchased along with payment information right below."
msgstr ""
"Gràcies per la teva comanda! Trobaràs un resum dels productes que has "
"comprat a continuació així com la informació de pagament."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/order/created.html:37
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/order/created.html:37
msgid "Payment options"
msgstr "Com pagar"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/order/paid.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/order/paid.html:5
msgid ""
"Your order has been marked as paid! You will find a summary of the products "
"you have purchased right below."
msgstr ""
"La teva comanda s'ha marcat com a pagada! Trobaràs un resum dels productes "
"que has comprat a continuació."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/payment/paid.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/payment/paid.html:5
msgid ""
"Your payment has been processed and it's on its way to you! You will find a "
"summary right below."
msgstr ""
"El vostre pagament s'ha processat i ja és de camí! En trobaràs un resum a "
"continuació."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/registration/paid.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/registration/paid.html:5
msgid ""
"Your registration has been marked as paid! You will find a summary right "
"below."
msgstr ""
"La teva inscripció s'ha marcat com a pagada! En trobaràs un resum a "
"continuació."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:5
msgid ""
"We are very excited to introduce to you our new website, a new way of "
"managing your membership and registering for events. We are reaching out to "
"give you a quick run down of some new features and hopefully answer any "
"questions you may have regarding the system."
msgstr ""
"Estem molt contents d'introduïr la nostra nova web, una manera nova "
"d'administrar la teva quota i registrar-te als esdeveniments. T'enviem aquest "
"correu per donar-te un resum ràpid d'algunes de les funcions i alhora "
"resoldre qualsevol dubte que hi pugui haver sobre el sistema."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:6
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:6
msgid "Right now, the following features are up and running on our site."
msgstr ""
"Ara mateix les següents funcionalitats es poden fer servir a la nostra web."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:8
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:8
msgid "Membership and family management."
msgstr "Quotes i gestió de família"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:9
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:10
msgid "Payments overview."
msgstr "Historial de pagaments."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:10
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:11
msgid "Google single sign-on (optional)."
msgstr "Entra amb Google (opcional)."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:12
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:13
msgid ""
"We have more features coming soon, and will keep you all updated as we "
"continue to implement them on the site."
msgstr ""
"Tenim més funcionalitats que encara estem desenvolupant i et mantindrem "
"informat quan les implementem a la nostra web."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/imported.html:13
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:14
msgid ""
"As you currently have a membership registered we have automatically migrated "
"your data to the new platform, you can set a new password via the link below "
"or use Google single sign-on directly on our website if you wish to."
