#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/invite.html:7
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/invite.html:7
msgid ""
"As you are already a member the only thing you need to do is to accept the "
"invitation if you wish to merge your families. You can do this by logging "
"in, navigating to your dashboard and reviewing your invitations under "
"\"Family requests\"."
msgstr ""
"Si ja ets membre l'única cosa que et cal fer és acceptar la invitació si "
"vols combinar les vostres famílies. Pots fer-ho entrant a la web, navegant "
"al teu perfil i revisant les invitacions a \"Peticions de família\"."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/invite.html:9
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/invite.html:9
msgid ""
"In order to accept this invitation you first need to become a member which "
"you can do directly in our website. After having registered and confirmed "
"your email you will be able to accept this invitation under \"Family requests"
"\" on your dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Per tal d'acceptar aquesta invitació primer has de fer-te membre, ho pots "
"fer directament a la nostra web. Una vegada registrat i confirmat el teu "
"correu podràs acceptar aquesta invitació a \"Peticions de família\" al teu "
"perfil."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/invite.html:15
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/invite.html:15
