#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/password.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/password.html:5
msgid ""
"Did you request to change your password? To update it click on the following "
"button. If you didn't request this you can ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Has demanat canviar la contrasenya? Per actualitzar-la fes clic al següent "
"botó. Si no has fet aquesta petició pots ignorar aquest correu."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/password.html:10
