msgid "Change password"
msgstr "Canviar la contrasenya"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/register.html:5
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/register.html:5
msgid ""
"Thank you for joining! In order to complete your registration we need you to "
"confirm this email as soon as possible by clicking the following button."
msgstr ""
"Moltes gràcies per unir-te! Per tal de finalitzer el registre ens cal que "
"confirmis aquest correu el més aviat possible fent clic al següent botó."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/register.html:10
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/register.html:10
msgid "Confirm email"
msgstr "Confirma el teu correu"

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/welcome.html:5
msgid ""
"Your email is now confirmed and you are very close from being part of Les "
"Quatre Barres. In order to complete your registration you only have to pay "
"for your membership. To do that, click on the button below and follow the "
"steps to make the payment."
msgstr ""
"El vostre correu electrònic s'ha confirmat i esteu a punt de formar part de "
"Les Quatre Barres. Per completar el registre només heu de pagar la quota. "
"Per fer-ho, feu clic al botó següent i seguiu els passos per fer el pagament."

#: comunicat/templates/email/org/user/welcome.html:14
msgid "Pay the membership"
msgstr "Paga la quota"

#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/check.html:48
#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/membership/renew.html:10
msgid ""
"In your dashboard you can find instructions on how to renew your membership "
"as well as the payment information."
msgstr ""
"Al teu perfil trobaràs les instruccions per renovar la quota així com la "
"informació de pagament."

#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:5
msgid ""
"We are very excited to introduce to you our new website, a new way of "
"managing your membership and registering for rehearsals. We are reaching out "
"to give you a quick run down of some new features and hopefully answer any "
"questions you may have regarding the system."
msgstr ""
"Estem molt contents d'introduïr la nostra nova web, una manera nova "
"d'administrar la teva quota i registrar-te pels assajos. T'enviem aquest "
"correu per donar-te un resum ràpid d'algunes de les funcions i alhora "
"resoldre qualsevol dubte que hi pugui haver sobre el sistema."

#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:9
msgid "Calendar and events registration."
msgstr "Calendari i registre d'esdeveniments."

#: comunicat/templates/email/towers/user/imported.html:23
